l rung"}]},{"id":"blk-63817","spans":[{"id":"spn-93958","text":"Graphonomous implementation"}]},{"id":"blk-63818","spans":[{"id":"spn-93959","text":"Compliance"}]}],"id":"blk-63815","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-63819","spans":[{"id":"spn-93960","text":"1. alethic ("},{"id":"spn-93961","marks":["code"],"text":"value"},{"id":"spn-93962","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-63820","spans":[{"id":"spn-93963","marks":["code"],"text":"Topology.compute_kappa/2"},{"id":"spn-93964","text":", SCC analysis; node confidence"}]},{"id":"blk-63821","spans":[{"id":"spn-93965","text":"✅ ~90% — κ is a first-class Value"}]}],[{"id":"blk-63822","spans":[{"id":"spn-93966","text":"2. axiological ("},{"id":"spn-93967","marks":["code"],"text":"score"},{"id":"spn-93968","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-63823","spans":[{"id":"spn-93969","marks":["code"],"text":"Coverage.weighted_sum/2"},{"id":"spn-93970","text":", "},{"id":"spn-93971","marks":["code"],"text":"Reranker"}]},{"id":"blk-63824","spans":[{"id":"spn-93972","text":"◻ ~60% — weighted sum, not a "},{"id":"spn-93973","marks":["italic"],"text":"named"},{"id":"spn-93974","text":" semiring"}]}],[{"id":"blk-63825","spans":[{"id":"spn-93975","text":"3. deontic (norm/govern)"}]},{"id":"blk-63826","spans":[{"id":"spn-93976","marks":["code"],"text":"Coverage.pick_decision/4"},{"id":"spn-93977","text":" floor gates (act/learn/escalate)"}]},{"id":"blk-63827","spans":[{"id":"spn-93978","text":"◻ ~70% — floor present, "},{"id":"spn-93979","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-93980","text":" veto implicit"}]}],[{"id":"blk-63828","spans":[{"id":"spn-93981","text":"4. temporal (LTL ▸ supervise)"}]},{"id":"blk-63829","spans":[{"id":"spn-93982","text":"consolidation cadence; freshness/staleness decay"}]},{"id":"blk-63830","spans":[{"id":"spn-93983","text":"◻ ~40% — time-aware, no LTL obligations"}]}],[{"id":"blk-63831","spans":[{"id":"spn-93984","text":"5. reflexive (entrenched ring-0)"}]},{"id":"blk-63832","spans":[{"id":"spn-93985","text":"— (no self-amendment